- Triaged issue #2 and documented the **small → medium (3,000 contigs, 5 GB cap) → large after major commits** workflow: [comment](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/2#issuecomment-5801330301).
- Final meta checks C1–C9: all `ok`. Cron active, OpenCode service/API healthy, agent driver alive, Git clean and synchronized with `origin/main`.
- Supervisor commits pushed: `899f7e7`, `b37780e`, `00e300f`.
