    39	
    40	Living table: **one row per benchmark run**, updated by the agent immediately after
    41	each run (timings from `runs/<run>/run_meta.txt` + stage timings in the run log;
    42	quality from the CheckM2/CheckM evaluation — see `docs/04-evaluation.md`).
    43	Raw per-run outputs stay in `/vol/data/benchmark/runs/`, parsed CSVs in `results/`.
