    46	|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
    47	| `baseline_unmodified` | – | [987db95](https://github.com/paulzierep/COMEBin/commit/987db95d8d399f30b7c82a5f5f40ed6bfdc906c7) (upstream) | COMEBin demo (29,434 contigs) | 32 | – | – | – | – | – | ⏳ running · epoch 159/200 · loss 2.86026930809021 · top1 98.94856262207031 |
    48	
    49	Column contract: **Wall time** = total seconds (plus per-stage breakdown in
    50	`docs/02-comebin-baseline.md`), **Bins** = bins exported (≥200 kb filter noted),
    51	**comp/cont** = mean completeness / mean contamination, **HQ/MQ counts** live in
    52	`results/<run>.csv`. **Source commit** is always a clickable link to that exact
    53	commit on GitHub. Fix batches on `comebin-optimizations` get one row each, so
    54	performance deltas vs. baseline are visible directly in this table.
